Audio Duration: 3m 54.9s (234.92s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 15:02:50 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 0.98)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,440 --> 00:00:03,440] | Elapsed:  14.05s | Words: 16 | Text: 我二十多岁的时候就已经有十几年的工作经历了
Segment #2   [00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:04,560] | Elapsed:  14.05s | Words: 6  | Text: 但是心想是创意
Segment #3   [00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:06,940] | Elapsed:  14.05s | Words: 11 | Text: 当时身边的朋友能不能帮上毛
Segment #4   [00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:07,780] | Elapsed:  14.05s | Words: 5  | Text: 咱还不谈啊
Segment #5   [00:00:07,780 --> 00:00:10,740] | Elapsed:  14.05s | Words: 15 | Text: 突然发现他妈很多人都已经无话可说了
Segment #6   [00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:12,560] | Elapsed:  14.05s | Words: 9  | Text: 就连个同频的人都找不到
Segment #7   [00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:13,720] | Elapsed:  14.05s | Words: 4  | Text: 很不理解
Segment #8   [00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:15,660] | Elapsed:  14.05s | Words: 9  | Text: 别人所说的这种资源
Segment #9   [00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:17,020] | Elapsed:  14.05s | Words: 7  | Text: 我怎么就不具备呢
Segment #10  [00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:19,200] | Elapsed:  14.05s | Words: 10 | Text: 为什么别的人有很多人二十多岁
Segment #11  [00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:21,460] | Elapsed:  14.05s | Words: 16 | Text: 就有这种做买卖的意识和进取的思维
Segment #12  [00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:22,740] | Elapsed:  14.05s | Words: 5  | Text: 我怎么就不行呢
Segment #13  [00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:24,000] | Elapsed:  14.05s | Words: 3  | Text: 那个时候啊
Segment #14  [00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,020] | Elapsed:  14.05s | Words: 10 | Text: 我就意识到一个很严重的问题
Segment #15  [00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:28,340] | Elapsed:  14.05s | Words: 8  | Text: 就是我和我的朋友们之间
Segment #16  [00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:31,200] | Elapsed:  30.13s | Words: 11 | Text: 好像从来都没有聊过关于人生
Segment #17  [00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:33,220] | Elapsed:  30.13s | Words: 9  | Text: 未来事业的这种话题
Segment #18  [00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:35,420] | Elapsed:  30.13s | Words: 10 | Text: 也从来都没有过彼此之间
Segment #19  [00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:37,740] | Elapsed:  30.13s | Words: 10 | Text: 挑毛病破冷水这种经历
Segment #20  [00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:39,640] | Elapsed:  30.13s | Words: 9  | Text: 那常年在一起还剩什么呢
Segment #21  [00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:41,100] | Elapsed:  30.13s | Words: 4  | Text: 醉生梦死
Segment #22  [00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:43,460] | Elapsed:  30.13s | Words: 9  | Text: 吃吃喝喝喝酒聚会呗
Segment #23  [00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:45,300] | Elapsed:  30.13s | Words: 9  | Text: 中心思想就他们一句话
Segment #24  [00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:47,100] | Elapsed:  30.13s | Words: 8  | Text: 拐弯抹角地炫耀自己
Segment #25  [00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:48,560] | Elapsed:  30.13s | Words: 9  | Text: 天佑家属的便利别人
Segment #26  [00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:50,820] | Elapsed:  30.14s | Words: 8  | Text: 互相符合白龙是非
Segment #27  [00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:53,120] | Elapsed:  30.14s | Words: 11 | Text: 你细想不就剩这点破事了
Segment #28  [00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:55,200] | Elapsed:  30.14s | Words: 10 | Text: 那这种圈子还能健康吗
Segment #29  [00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:57,320] | Elapsed:  30.14s | Words: 7  | Text: 你说偶尔人牵人后
Segment #30  [00:00:57,320 --> 00:00:59,440] | Elapsed:  46.15s | Words: 11 | Text: 给你点面子给你绑点熊吗
Segment #31  [00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:01,460] | Elapsed:  46.15s | Words: 8  | Text: 这些东西对我们来说
Segment #32  [00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:03,200] | Elapsed:  46.15s | Words: 2  | Text: 重要吗
Segment #33  [00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:04,860] | Elapsed:  46.15s | Words: 8  | Text: 我当时心想就够了
Segment #34  [00:01:04,860 --> 00:01:06,020] | Elapsed:  46.15s | Words: 6  | Text: 重要的就是朋友在一起
Segment #35  [00:01:06,020 --> 00:01:06,740] | Elapsed:  46.15s | Words: 3  | Text: 就是开心
Segment #36  [00:01:07,320 --> 00:01:08,780] | Elapsed:  46.15s | Words: 9  | Text: 只要玩的好的都是我兄弟
Segment #37  [00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:10,260] | Elapsed:  46.15s | Words: 5  | Text: 但是后来一想
Segment #38  [00:01:10,260 --> 00:01:11,660] | Elapsed:  46.15s | Words: 6  | Text: 真正缺少的是什么
Segment #39  [00:01:12,160 --> 00:01:14,480] | Elapsed:  46.15s | Words: 10 | Text: 是事业是谈途是知识面
Segment #40  [00:01:14,480 --> 00:01:16,640] | Elapsed:  46.15s | Words: 8  | Text: 是对你善意的纠正
Segment #41  [00:01:16,640 --> 00:01:18,320] | Elapsed:  46.15s | Words: 9  | Text: 把有价值的心情经历
Segment #42  [00:01:18,320 --> 00:01:19,140] | Elapsed:  46.15s | Words: 3  | Text: 分享给你
Segment #43  [00:01:19,140 --> 00:01:20,140] | Elapsed:  46.15s | Words: 3  | Text: 这个才重要
Segment #44  [00:01:20,860 --> 00:01:22,260] | Elapsed:  46.15s | Words: 7  | Text: 有人说娶老婆称压
Segment #45  [00:01:22,260 --> 00:01:23,620] | Elapsed:  46.15s | Words: 6  | Text: 一定得选个好人
Segment #46  [00:01:23,620 --> 00:01:25,080] | Elapsed:  46.15s | Words: 8  | Text: 因为她会决定你的医生
Segment #47  [00:01:25,080 --> 00:01:26,340] | Elapsed:  62.58s | Words: 5  | Text: 负责人的讲
Segment #48  [00:01:26,340 --> 00:01:27,580] | Elapsed:  62.58s | Words: 3  | Text: 朋友更重要
Segment #49  [00:01:28,060 --> 00:01:28,980] | Elapsed:  62.58s | Words: 4  | Text: 最佳的朋友
Segment #50  [00:01:28,980 --> 00:01:30,640] | Elapsed:  62.58s | Words: 9  | Text: 是你人生战场的盟友
Segment #51  [00:01:30,640 --> 00:01:32,400] | Elapsed:  62.58s | Words: 9  | Text: 不是你找了一些人满足了
Segment #52  [00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:33,700] | Elapsed:  62.58s | Words: 8  | Text: 你平时消遣的需求
Segment #53  [00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:35,440] | Elapsed:  62.59s | Words: 4  | Text: 那个是内耗
Segment #54  [00:01:36,020 --> 00:01:37,360] | Elapsed:  62.59s | Words: 6  | Text: 所以说真正的朋友
Segment #55  [00:01:37,360 --> 00:01:38,620] | Elapsed:  62.59s | Words: 7  | Text: 是可欲不可求的
Segment #56  [00:01:38,620 --> 00:01:40,040] | Elapsed:  62.59s | Words: 4  | Text: 我们得珍惜
Segment #57  [00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:42,980] | Elapsed:  62.59s | Words: 11 | Text: 选择和我们不乏一致的人前行
Segment #58  [00:01:42,980 --> 00:01:43,760] | Elapsed:  62.59s | Words: 2  | Text: 如果没有
Segment #59  [00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:44,800] | Elapsed:  62.59s | Words: 5  | Text: 我们就一个人都
Segment #60  [00:01:45,360 --> 00:01:46,780] | Elapsed:  62.59s | Words: 6  | Text: 另外你看当年社会
Segment #61  [00:01:46,780 --> 00:01:48,320] | Elapsed:  62.59s | Words: 7  | Text: 他们喝酒成熊道地
Segment #62  [00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,740] | Elapsed:  62.59s | Words: 8  | Text: 这个利益而于我这儿
Segment #63  [00:01:51,660 --> 00:01:53,080] | Elapsed:  62.59s | Words: 5  | Text: 今天傻血为猛
Segment #64  [00:01:53,080 --> 00:01:54,520] | Elapsed:  62.59s | Words: 6  | Text: 明天破苦大麻
Segment #65  [00:01:54,520 --> 00:01:56,080] | Elapsed:  77.91s | Words: 6  | Text: 这不太正常了
Segment #66  [00:01:56,080 --> 00:01:57,300] | Elapsed:  77.91s | Words: 5  | Text: 太多人都觉得
Segment #67  [00:01:57,300 --> 00:01:59,460] | Elapsed:  77.91s | Words: 7  | Text: 哎呀你不够一切
Segment #68  [00:01:59,460 --> 00:02:00,920] | Elapsed:  77.91s | Words: 7  | Text: 我对你多好多好
Segment #69  [00:02:00,920 --> 00:02:01,720] | Elapsed:  77.91s | Words: 5  | Text: 你却不帮我
Segment #70  [00:02:01,720 --> 00:02:02,460] | Elapsed:  77.91s | Words: 4  | Text: 等等这种问题
Segment #71  [00:02:02,940 --> 00:02:03,700] | Elapsed:  77.91s | Words: 3  | Text: 那如果说
Segment #72  [00:02:03,700 --> 00:02:04,680] | Elapsed:  77.91s | Words: 5  | Text: 我就想问一下朋友
Segment #73  [00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:05,720] | Elapsed:  77.91s | Words: 4  | Text: 如果说在一起
Segment #74  [00:02:05,720 --> 00:02:06,700] | Elapsed:  77.91s | Words: 5  | Text: 出哥们出朋友
Segment #75  [00:02:06,700 --> 00:02:08,840] | Elapsed:  77.91s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是用来帮忙的吗
Segment #76  [00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:10,140] | Elapsed:  77.91s | Words: 6  | Text: 那如果是你的目的
Segment #77  [00:02:10,140 --> 00:02:10,900] | Elapsed:  77.91s | Words: 4  | Text: 不单纯的
Segment #78  [00:02:10,900 --> 00:02:12,440] | Elapsed:  77.91s | Words: 9  | Text: 或者说你千万是跑偏的
Segment #79  [00:02:13,020 --> 00:02:13,860] | Elapsed:  77.91s | Words: 3  | Text: 什么是朋友
Segment #80  [00:02:14,420 --> 00:02:15,460] | Elapsed:  77.91s | Words: 3  | Text: 我觉得朋友就是
Segment #81  [00:02:15,900 --> 00:02:17,980] | Elapsed:  77.91s | Words: 8  | Text: 多一些互相审视自己的人
Segment #82  [00:02:17,980 --> 00:02:19,280] | Elapsed:  77.91s | Words: 4  | Text: 整理自己的人
Segment #83  [00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:21,020] | Elapsed:  77.91s | Words: 6  | Text: 不是以为的付出
Segment #84  [00:02:21,020 --> 00:02:22,240] | Elapsed:  77.91s | Words: 6  | Text: 道德式的绑架
Segment #85  [00:02:22,860 --> 00:02:23,780] | Elapsed:  95.30s | Words: 3  | Text: 我们也先
Segment #86  [00:02:23,780 --> 00:02:24,720] | Elapsed:  95.30s | Words: 5  | Text: 不要考虑对方
Segment #87  [00:02:24,720 --> 00:02:25,760] | Elapsed:  95.30s | Words: 7  | Text: 能不能和我们合得来
Segment #88  [00:02:25,760 --> 00:02:27,660] | Elapsed:  95.30s | Words: 7  | Text: 先相处一段时间看看
Segment #89  [00:02:27,660 --> 00:02:29,100] | Elapsed:  95.30s | Words: 7  | Text: 你仔细的观察一下
Segment #90  [00:02:29,100 --> 00:02:31,180] | Elapsed:  95.30s | Words: 7  | Text: 自己有没有变得更好
Segment #91  [00:02:31,180 --> 00:02:33,160] | Elapsed:  95.30s | Words: 6  | Text: 如果说没有一些改变
Segment #92  [00:02:33,160 --> 00:02:34,660] | Elapsed:  95.30s | Words: 8  | Text: 或者说变得更差劲了
Segment #93  [00:02:34,660 --> 00:02:36,020] | Elapsed:  95.30s | Words: 4  | Text: 那不好意思兄弟
Segment #94  [00:02:36,020 --> 00:02:38,120] | Elapsed:  95.30s | Words: 7  | Text: 你这个圈子就是病派
Segment #95  [00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:39,020] | Elapsed:  95.30s | Words: 3  | Text: 朋友之间
Segment #96  [00:02:39,020 --> 00:02:40,280] | Elapsed:  95.30s | Words: 7  | Text: 确实要保持这种
Segment #97  [00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:42,340] | Elapsed:  95.30s | Words: 10 | Text: 长期的这种舒适的关系
Segment #98  [00:02:42,340 --> 00:02:43,240] | Elapsed:  95.30s | Words: 4  | Text: 那怎么保持
Segment #99  [00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:45,560] | Elapsed:  95.30s | Words: 7  | Text: 不是天天在一起玩啊
Segment #100 [00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:46,980] | Elapsed:  95.30s | Words: 5  | Text: 是互相供领
Segment #101 [00:02:46,980 --> 00:02:47,940] | Elapsed:  95.30s | Words: 4  | Text: 互相滋养
Segment #102 [00:02:47,940 --> 00:02:49,060] | Elapsed:  95.30s | Words: 4  | Text: 共同升职
Segment #103 [00:02:49,060 --> 00:02:50,380] | Elapsed:  95.30s | Words: 6  | Text: 达到彼此之间
Segment #104 [00:02:50,380 --> 00:02:51,260] | Elapsed:  95.30s | Words: 6  | Text: 这种都能遇到
